  "body": "## Summary\n\nInstalls Sepo agent infrastructure into `lm4sci/lm4sci.github.io` on branch `agent/install-agent-infra`.\n\n## Source\n\n- Sepo source repo: `self-evolving/repo`\n- Selected ref: `v0.2.0`\n- Commit SHA: `810dfcaf206c03a805f4b3d072bf50900fe0d3ed`\n- Release URL: https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/releases/tag/v0.2.0\n- Fallback reason: no non-draft stable release was available, so the latest non-draft prerelease was used.\n\n## Installed\n\n- Added `.agent/` from the Sepo source checkout, excluding generated/dependency directories:\n  - `.agent/dist/`\n  - `.agent/node_modules/`\n  - `.agent/.git`\n- Added Sepo-owned `.github/actions/`, `.github/prompts/`, and Sepo agent workflow files under `.github/workflows/`.\n- Updated `.gitignore` with `.agent/dist/` and `.agent/node_modules/`.\n\n## Preserved and skipped\n\n- Preserved existing target-owned `.github/workflows/nextjs.yml`.\n- No same-path `.github` overwrite was required.\n- No optional `.skills/` skill or root `AGENT.md` was requested, so none was added.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Resolved install target with `resolve-install-target.js`: `lm4sci/lm4sci.github.io`.\n- Prepared fork-backed worktree with `install-fork-pr.js prepare`.\n- Confirmed `GH_TOKEN` was present.\n- Audited source and target `.github` paths before copying; found no same-path collisions.\n- Confirmed `.agent/dist/` and `.agent/node_modules/` were not copied.\n- Reviewed staged install diff: 271 files changed, 45,764 insertions.\n- Ran `git diff --cached --check`: passed.\n- Full Sepo test suite was not run; this PR copies released infrastructure into the target repository.\n\n## Required setup after merge\n\n1. Install the Sepo GitHub App on the target repository, or choose another supported auth path from the setup guide.\n2. Add `OPENAI_API_KEY` and/or `CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN`.\n3. Run **Actions > Agent / Onboarding / Check Setup**.\n4. Review the `Sepo setup check` issue and complete remaining setup.\n5. Initialize `agent/memory` if missing.\n6. Optionally initialize `agent/rubrics`.\n\nSource install request: https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/issues/308\n<!-- sepo-install-source-request: https://github.com/self-evolving/repo/issues/308 -->\n",
